{
  "id": "fuel_gases___combustion_values",
  "title": "Fuel Gases - Combustion Values",
  "description": "Combustion values for fuel gases like natural gas, propane and butane - Btu per cubic feet.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Combustion Values Reference\n\nCombustion (heat) values for some fuel gases. Use the calculator below to convert between different energy units.\n\n**Conversion Factor:** 1 Btu/ft³ = 8.9 kcal/m³ = 3.73×10⁴ J/m³"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "combustion_value_btu",
          "label": "Combustion Value",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Btu/ft³",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "combustion_value_kcal",
          "label": "Combustion Value",
          "unit": "kcal/m³",
          "formula": "inputs.combustion_value_btu * 8.9",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "combustion_value_j",
          "label": "Combustion Value",
          "unit": "J/m³",
          "formula": "inputs.combustion_value_btu * 37300",
          "format": "scientific"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
